{"type":"text","timestamp":1794344809494,"sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","part":{"id":"prt_1c748f3fe001Ljde2IeL3QYR3B","messageID":"msg_1c748e967001CklQqJXFyxPz9R","sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","type":"text","text":"<think>The server was killed when the shell command timed out. I need to start the server detached properly using setsid and nohup so it survives.\n\nLet me use `setsid nohup ... < /dev/null > log 2>&1 &` and then `disown`.\n\nThe issue: the bash tool likely kills the process group on timeout. Using setsid detaches it into a new session.\n\nLet me write a small script to start the server detached.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794344809470,"end":1794344809490}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794344839634,"sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01a1c748f0b976f4b4979efc","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace && rm -rf data && setsid nohup .venv/bin/python -c \"\nimport sys; sys.path.insert(0,'backend')\nfrom app import app\napp.run(host='127.0.0.1', port=8000, debug=False, use_reloader=False)\n\" < /dev/null > /tmp/devserver.log 2>&1 & disown; sleep 3; curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health; echo","timeout":30000},"output":"{\"status\":\"ok\"}\n\n\n\n<shell_metadata>\nshell tool terminated command after exceeding timeout 30000 ms. If this command is expected to take longer and is not waiting for interactive input, retry with a larger timeout value in milliseconds.\n</shell_metadata>","metadata":{"output":"{\"status\":\"ok\"}\n\n","exit":null,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace && rm -rf data && setsid nohup .venv/bin/python -c \"\nimport sys; sys.path.insert(0,'backend')\nfrom app import app\napp.run(host='127.0.0.1', port=8000, debug=False, use_reloader=False)\n\" < /dev/null > /tmp/devserver.log 2>&1 & disown; sleep 3; curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health; echo","time":{"start":1794344809481,"end":1794344839608}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c748f401001kPwUqy7yS6Tg5P","sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","messageID":"msg_1c748e967001CklQqJXFyxPz9R"}}
