{"type":"text","timestamp":1794345011997,"sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","part":{"id":"prt_1c74c0b0b001m7lUhCWkKhui84","messageID":"msg_1c74c015a0017mvgi2yvLKbl1K","sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","type":"text","text":"<think>The build works and Tailwind CSS is being generated (20.98 kB CSS). Let me verify Tailwind classes are actually in the CSS (e.g. `bg-indigo-600`).\n\nAlso I should check that the CSS includes the utilities I used. Let me grep the built CSS.\n\nThen, let me typecheck with TypeScript. Is typescript installed? Let me check and install it as a devDependency for type checking (optional). Let me check node_modules/typescript.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794345011979,"end":1794345011994}}}
