dd the first customer to get started.No customersPer page102050100Page 1 of 1PreviousNext\n  \n\n\n  FAIL list shows phone column :: \n    CDCustomer DirectorySigned in as alexSign outCustomersEveryone on the team shares this list and can edit any record.+Add customerSearch customersFilter by companyAll companiesThe customer list could not be loaded. Please try again.NameEmailPhoneCompanyLast contactedNo customers foundAdd the first customer to get started.No customersPer page102050100Page 1 of 1PreviousNext\n  \n\n\n  FAIL list shows company column :: \n    CDCustomer DirectorySigned in as alexSign outCustomersEveryone on the team shares this list and can edit any record.+Add customerSearch customersFilter by companyAll companiesThe customer list could not be loaded. Please try again.NameEmailPhoneCompanyLast contactedNo customers foundAdd the first customer to get started.No customersPer page102050100Page 1 of 1PreviousNext\n  \n\n\n  ok   list shows last contacted\n  ok   search box present\n  ok   company filter present\n  ok   paging present\n  FAIL table has one row per customer :: rows=1\n  FAIL search filters the table :: \n    CDCustomer DirectorySigned in as alexSign outCustomersEveryone on the team shares this list and can edit any record.+Add customerSearch customersFilter by companyAll companiesThe customer list could not be loaded. Please try again.NameEmailPhoneCompanyLast contactedNo customers foundTry a different search or clear the company filter.No customersPer page102050100Page 1 of 1PreviousNext\n  \n\n\n  FAIL customer row links to the detail page :: no link\nTypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'dispatchEvent')\n    at main (file:///workspace/.e2e/frontend.test.mjs:286:12)\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace/.e2e && timeout 180 node frontend.test.mjs 2>&1 | tail -60","time":{"start":1794345099534,"end":1794345102408}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c74d6108001OKazQFwrQ4Is8W","