k   search filters the table\n  ok   customer row links to the detail page\n  ok   detail page opens\n  ok   detail shows contact details\n  ok   detail has edit action\n  ok   detail has delete action\n  ok   detail has interaction log\n  ok   detail has log form\n  ok   interaction appears in the log\n  ok   interaction shows who logged it\n  ok   interaction shows the kind\n  ok   edit form opens\n  ok   edit form is prefilled\n  ok   edit saves and returns to the detail page\n  FAIL add customer button present :: missing\nTypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'dispatchEvent')\n    at main (file:///workspace/.e2e/frontend.test.mjs:331:13)\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace/.e2e && timeout 180 node frontend.test.mjs 2>&1 | tail -40","time":{"start":1794345118190,"end":1794345123243}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c74da9e8001vWPElk0A2brHMX","sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","messageID":"msg_1c74da0b3001gfVLZ742ky1keb"}}
