{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794345127512,"sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","part":{"id":"prt_1c74dce44001BEpzNqI2RD5czg","messageID":"msg_1c74dbdb8001CAAzrbS5x3a4F6","sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794345127512,"sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","part":{"id":"prt_1c74dce48001wo2dV4Z54mhB7C","messageID":"msg_1c74dbdb8001CAAzrbS5x3a4F6","sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","type":"text","text":"<think>The \"add customer button present\" check failed because after the edit save we're on the customer detail page, not the list. The \"Add customer\" button is on the list page. I need to navigate back to the list first.\n\nLet me fix the test: navigate to /customers via history.pushState + popstate, or click the \"Back to customers\" link. React Router listens to popstate. In jsdom, `window.history.pushState` doesn't trigger a popstate event, so I need to dispatch it manually.\n\nSimplest: click the \"← Back to customers\" link (it's an <a> with href=\"/customers\" — clicking it in jsdom does a full navigation... jsdom doesn't implement navigation for pushState-based routing; a click on an anchor in jsdom triggers \"Not implemented: navigation\" error but doesn't change the URL).\n\nHmm, how did the earlier link click work (\"Acme Contact\" link and \"Edit\" link)? React Router's <Link> intercepts clicks and calls preventDefault + history.pushState, so the URL changed without a real navigation. So the \"← Back to customers\" Link will work the same way.\n\nLet me use that link. In the detail page there's a link with text \"← Back to customers\". I'll find it by text \"Back to customers\".\n\nLet me update the test.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794345127496,"end":1794345127509}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794345127538,"sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_01a1c74dc9ab744bb771e03c","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/.e2e/frontend.test.mjs","newString":"  const backLink = byText(\"a\", \"Back to customers\");\n  check(\"back link present\", Boolean(backLink), \"missing\");\n  backLink.dispatchEvent(new window.MouseEvent(\"click\", { bubbles: true, cancelable: true, button: 0 }));\n  await wait(500);\n  check(\"back to the list\", window.location.pathname === \"/customers\", window.location.href);\n\n  const newButton = byText(\"a\", \"Add customer\");","oldString":"  window.location.hash = \"\";\n  const newButton = byText(\"a\", \"Add customer\");"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/.e2e/frontend.test.mjs\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/.e2e/frontend.test.mjs\n+++ /workspace/.e2e/frontend.test.mjs\n@@ -324,9 +324,14 @@\n editForm.dispatchEvent(new window.Event(\"submit\", { bubbles: true, cancelable: true }));\n await wait(600);\n check(\"edit saves and returns to the detail page\", text().includes(\"Acme Contact Renamed\"), text().slice(0, 400));\n \n-window.location.hash = \"\";\n+const backLink = byText(\"a\", \"Back to customers\");\n+check(\"back link present\", Boolean(backLink), \"missing\");\n+backLink.dispatchEvent(new window.MouseEvent(\"click\", { bubbles: true, cancelable: true, button: 0 }));\n+await wait(500);\n+check(\"back to the list\", window.location.pathname === \"/customers\", window.location.href);\n+\n const newButton = byText(\"a\", \"Add customer\");\n check(\"add customer button present\", Boolean(newButton), \"missing\");\n newButton.dispatchEvent(new window.MouseEvent(\"click\", { bubbles: true, cancelable: true, button: 0 }));\n await wait(500);\n","filediff":{"file":"/workspace/.e2e/frontend.test.mjs","patch":"Index: /workspace/.e2e/frontend.test.mjs\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/.e2e/frontend.test.mjs\n+++ /workspace/.e2e/frontend.test.mjs\n@@ -324,9 +324,14 @@\n editForm.dispatchEvent(new window.Event(\"submit\", { bubbles: true, cancelable: true }));\n await wait(600);\n check(\"edit saves and returns to the detail page\", text().includes(\"Acme Contact Renamed\"), text().slice(0, 400));\n \n-window.location.hash = \"\";\n+const backLink = byText(\"a\", \"Back to customers\");\n+check(\"back link present\", Boolean(backLink), \"missing\");\n+backLink.dispatchEvent(new window.MouseEvent(\"click\", { bubbles: true, cancelable: true, button: 0 }));\n+await wait(500);\n+check(\"back to the list\", window.location.pathname === \"/customers\", window.location.href);\n+\n const newButton = byText(\"a\", \"Add customer\");\n check(\"add customer button present\", Boolean(newButton), \"missing\");\n newButton.dispatchEvent(new window.MouseEvent(\"click\", { bubbles: true, cancelable: true, button: 0 }));\n await wait(500);\n","additions":6,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":".e2e/frontend.test.mjs","time":{"start":1794345127506,"end":1794345127519}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c74dce4b001UNl5udIb61Rypg","sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","messageID":"msg_1c74dbdb8001CAAzrbS5x3a4F6"}}
