{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794345141437,"sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","part":{"id":"prt_1c74e04a5001DLfo2S0L6fFdKW","messageID":"msg_1c74df3ab001q3QHLbYLGgs4rh","sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794345141438,"sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","part":{"id":"prt_1c74e04a800122pFHxJ7gX0cZV","messageID":"msg_1c74df3ab001q3QHLbYLGgs4rh","sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","type":"text","text":"<think>All frontend checks pass, including the duplicate-email validation message display.\n\nNow let me:\n1. Clean up the .e2e scratch directory (or keep it? It has its own node_modules; it would bloat the repo. I'll delete it — but maybe keep the test file as documentation? The task doesn't require frontend tests. I'll delete the whole .e2e dir to keep the deliverable clean. Actually, I could keep the test but it depends on jsdom in a separate package.json... Let me just delete it.)\n\nActually, wait. Let me reconsider: having the frontend test in the repo would be valuable, but it requires jsdom as a devDependency of the frontend project. The instructions say to build the app on top of the minimal project; extra test infrastructure is optional. I'll keep the repo clean: delete .e2e. But keep tests/api_test.py since it has no external dependencies (stdlib only) and is a useful artifact.\n\n2. Verify the Docker build works and the container serves everything on port 8000.\n3. Also double-check: the backend serves the frontend build at \"/\" — the DIST path in app.py is computed relative to the backend file: `os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(abspath(__file__)))/frontend/dist`. In the Docker image, backend/ is copied to /app/backend/ and frontend/dist to /app/frontend/dist → DIST = /app/frontend/dist. Correct.\n\n4. Check `data/` persistence across restarts.\n\nLet me now check if docker is available in this sandbox.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794345141417,"end":1794345141433}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794345141473,"sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01a1c74e022e7160bc9cfea3","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"which docker podman 2>/dev/null; docker version 2>&1 | head -5"},"output":"/usr/bin/bash: line 1: docker: command not found\n","metadata":{"output":"/usr/bin/bash: line 1: docker: command not found\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"which docker podman 2>/dev/null; docker version 2>&1 | head -5","time":{"start":1794345141425,"end":1794345141447}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c74e04ab001wTyvzQ3jUZH3Je","sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","messageID":"msg_1c74df3ab001q3QHLbYLGgs4rh"}}
