{"type":"text","timestamp":1794345235014,"sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","part":{"id":"prt_1c74f7233001dFlPSpfqdB0kth","messageID":"msg_1c74f66ed001Fwpd1neW38QjYH","sessionID":"ses_e38be2834ffeyfE9hooqtrOekt","type":"text","text":"<think>Everything works with gunicorn: the frontend is served, deep links work, assets are served, and the API passes all 44 checks.\n\nNow let me test persistence across a restart: the data dir has the DB; restart gunicorn and check the data is still there.\n\nAlso verify the data directory location: ./data relative to CWD (/workspace/data).\n\nLet me check the data dir contents and restart.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794345234995,"end":1794345235010}}}
